      en: ["Rufisque was declared Senegal's third full-fledged commune in 1880.", "In the 19th century, it was the most important port for peanut exports.", "Inhabitants had the right to elect deputies to the French parliament.", "Colonial architecture in the Escale district dates mainly from the 1860s.", "The city was originally settled by the Lebu ethnic group.", "The arrival of the railway in 1885 boosted the city's commercial boom."],
