      en: ["The palace was built on the foundations of a fort dating back to 1659.", "It was the seat of government for all French West Africa until 1902.", "The building directly faces the central square, Place Faidherbe.", "Saint-Louis remained the official capital of Senegal until 1957.", "The current structure dates mostly from the 18th and 19th centuries.", "The palace is an integral part of the city's UNESCO World Heritage status."],
      es: ["Construido sobre las ruinas de un antiguo fuerte.", "Desarrollado en el siglo XVIII como residencia.", "Sede de la administración colonial de Senegal.", "Situado en la plaza central de Saint-Louis.", "Hoy, gobernanza regional.", "Importante construcción del centro de la UNESCO.", "Vinculado a la Plaza Faidherbe."],
      pt: ["Construído sobre as ruínas de um antigo forte.", "Desenvolvido no século XVIII como residência.", "Sede da administração colonial do Senegal.", "Localizado na praça central de Saint-Louis.", "Hoje, governança regional.", "Importante construção do centro da UNESCO.", "Vinculado à Praça Faidherbe."],
      fr: ["Construit sur les ruines d'un ancien fort.", "Développé au XVIIIe siècle comme résidence.", "Siège de l'administration coloniale du Sénégal.", "Situé sur la place centrale de Saint-Louis.", "Aujourd'hui, gouvernance régionale.", "Construction importante du centre de l'UNESCO.", "Lié à la Place Faidherbe."],
